  "sourceTitle": "Colonial Cookies",
  "sourceText": "Colonial Cookies\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Thursday, February 11, 2010 - 7:54pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 cup Sugar\n1 cup Butter or margarine\n1 cup Flour\n2 cups Quick oats\n1 teaspoon Baking soda\n1 dsh Salt\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix dry ingredients; work in butter like a pie crust. Make into balls & flatten with bottom of glass dipped in sugar while on cookie sheet. Bake 12-15 minutes at 350.",
